{"seq":2,"slug":"the-milan-years","title":"米兰岁月（1482–1499）","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serving-the-sforza","title":"效力斯福尔扎（约1482–1499）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years/serving-the-sforza","wordCount":1514,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-mature-master","title":"成熟的大师（约1490s）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years/the-mature-master","wordCount":1528,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"米兰岁月-1482-1499\">米兰岁月（1482–1499）</h1><p>斯福尔扎宫廷的十七年是达·芬奇创造力最旺盛的黄金期。本章拆为「靠什么谋生」与「如何臻于成熟」两条线。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"serving-the-sforza\">效力斯福尔扎</a>：作为西方最早简历的自荐信、宫廷多功能承包商的职务清单、铜马工程与 1499 年法军入侵带来的崩解。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-mature-master\">成熟的大师</a>：晕涂法/明暗法的技法体系、观察—记录—类比的方法回路、《最后的晚餐》的技术豪赌与早衰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前置：建议先读 <a href=\"../early-life/\">早年与学徒</a>。读完本章转入 <a href=\"../later-wanderings/\">晚年与漂泊</a>。作品逐件分析见 <a href=\"../../major-works/\">主要作品</a>。</p>\n"}